JOBCTLPROBE(1)

NAME
    jobctlprobe - test stopped-job process control

SYNOPSIS
    jobctlprobe

DESCRIPTION
    Exercises the SmallOS job-control substrate used by BusyBox ash and other
    POSIX-style shells. The probe verifies stopped child reporting through
    waitpid WUNTRACED, process-group SIGTSTP delivery, SIGCONT resume, and
    killpg wrapper behavior.

NOTES
    This is primarily a diagnostic or self-test helper, but it is documented so
    installed programs are discoverable.

SEE ALSO
    waitprobe(1), sh(1), busybox(1), selftest(1)
